Package: flipFISH
Type: Package
Title: Performs barcode-decoding quality control for FISH-based spatial transcriptomic runs
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-07-09
Author: Michael Barkasi
Maintainer: Michael Barkasi <barkasi@wustl.edu>
Description: Tools for estimating the proportion of barcodes correctly decoded (i.e., "precision") in FISH-based spatial transcriptomics runs, via estimating bit-flip rates using blank counts, conditional probabilities, and dichotomized Gaussians.
License: GPL 3
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.13), RcppEigen
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen, BH, mvtnorm
Depends: ggplot2
SystemRequirements: NLopt
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
